WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:06.960
Love and Hate

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.500
Don't try to talk.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.040
I won't die!

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.960
Not before I've killed him!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.630
No! Stay back!

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.580
No! Stay back, please!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:33.130
Dammit, this can't happen!

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.670
I've followed them so far!

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.170
I don't want to die!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.250
I just want one good shot at him!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.040
He's not going to get away!

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.830
You won't...

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.630
You won't get away...

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:51.460
You won't... get... away...

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:55.330
I was searching for any oxygen cannisters
left in the wreckage.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.920
I'd realized that I had miscalculated.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.420
My oxygen was running out.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:08.290
My initial calculations had led me to believe that
I could just reach that unmanned supply station.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:14.750
But I'd sacrificed one more cannister
than I'd counted on.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.290
Zophie's presence was the reason.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.380
There's no point in coming after us.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.130
Even if you don't kill us, we're going to die.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.000
We don't have many cannisters left.

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.380
Fine with me!

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:18.830
Nothing will make me happier
than seeing you die!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.040
I'll do what I like!

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:28.420
Wonderful, isn't it?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.710
Each breath you take brings you closer to death!

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:38.000
I'm praying you hurry up and die!

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:42.210
I hope you and your woman drop dead soon!

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.380
Chirico... Give it...

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.830
Give it... to her...

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.040
Chirico...

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:30.170
Chirico, rest...

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.630
Chirico...

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.080
I... I love you...

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:48.420
Let's just... stay here...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.830
That date!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.380
Fate works in strange ways.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:22.380
That was the date I first met Fyana
in the darkness of Lido.

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.630
Well, looks like I'm finally in luck.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.380
Now then, are you prepared to die?

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.250
Must you?

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.420
Of course!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.710
What kind of nonsense is that to ask me now?!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:59.000
All right. Do what you want to me.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.080
But, in return, I want you to help Fyana.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.130
Like hell I will!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.960
Why should I help a Red Shoulder's woman?!

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.960
Because she has nothing to do with us!

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.000
If you leave her, she'll die.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.080
There's a map in my pocket.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:23.000
Take her to the supply station I've marked
and bathe her in liquid jijirium.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:26.960
You don't mind killing someone's
husband or children,

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.380
but you worry when it's
your own woman who's dying!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.580
Why don't I just let her die?

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.000
Nothing would make me happier
than seeing you both drop dead!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.580
Go on! Move!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.880
Go on!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.460
What the hell are you doing, you old bitch?!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:23.670
Lemme go! Get outta my way!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.250
Like hell I will! If I do, you'll shoot Chirico!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.130
???
Like hell I will! If I do, you'll shoot Chirico!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.880
Like hell I will! If I do, you'll shoot Chirico!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.420
Is Chirico in?

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.000
Get in, Zophie!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.330
Mind your own business! Let me go!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.420
Move it!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:46.290
Let me go!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.290
We're outta here!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.830
Come on, Pops! Get us straightened out!

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:01.460
Okay? If you don't wanna fall out,
then hang on tight!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.210
This way! Get us to this supply station!

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.250
Gotcha!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:21.330
That the place?

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.460
Looks like it.

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:03.500
Pops, your driving sucks!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.750
Sorry, sorry!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.670
Come on, hurry!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:17.460
Zophie!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.380
No! Zophie, don't!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:23.750
Zophie, I know how you feel!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:30.380
Chirico may have been a Red Shoulder,
but that doesn't mean he killed your family!

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:31.540
Let me go!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.710
Why, you...!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.460
Let me go! Let me go!

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.880
Zophie, stop it! Please!

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:38.540
Zophie!
Zophie, stop it! Please!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:39.920
Just stay out of this!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:49.790
If you two don't want to die with them,
then stay out of my way!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:50.920
Got that?!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:00.750
What are you trying to do to Chirico?!

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.250
Lemme go! I said let me go, you little bitch!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:06.960
Can't breathe...

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:11.750
Who are you to act like
you're the only victim here?!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.960
A kid like you has no right to lecture me!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:19.710
You'll never insult me again!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.460
Shut up, you old bitch!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.540
What about those crappy guns you sell?!

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:27.460
Mind your own business!

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:30.290
Those guns kill people, too!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.130
You little, snot-nosed...!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.790
Murderer!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:34.710
Everywhere I look, Chirico has friends!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.880
Leggo!
Everywhere I look, Chirico has friends!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.500
Everywhere I look, Chirico has friends!

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.380
Why, you...!

00:20:55.460 --> 00:21:00.290
You're not the only one who
lost her family in the war!

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:04.540
You act like you're special,
just 'cuz it happened to you!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.420
I'm never...

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:22.500
I'm never going to see my family again, either!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.580
Where's Chirico?

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:00.920
Take care of her.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.540
Zophie's left already.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:08.250
Looks like she doesn't want to
be around us anymore.

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.250
She hasn't forgiven you.

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:16.130
You'll be old and grey before she
ever lets go of all that hate.

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:25.460
I never answered her charges.

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:28.960
Even if I had told her the truth,

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:32.880
that my unit wasn't on this world
when her family was killed,

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:35.210
I still would have only been
making meaningless excuses.

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:40.250
Because I'd done the same thing in other places.

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:46.920
Even if she knew the truth,
she wouldn't forgive me.

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:50.630
And, in my heart, I felt the same way.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.080 --> 00:22:58.630
One who follows but who can never catch up.

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:01.500
One who desires but can never be fulfilled.

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.460
One driven mad by a thirst.
One whose wishes are denied him.

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:08.130
A life of murderous intent.
A life of hunger for battle.

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:12.750
Two men who carry hell within their hearts and
share a mysterious empathy for one another

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:15.080
now embark on a heroic final battle.

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:17.750
Next time, "Captives"

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:21.710
Only the flow of one man's blood
will quench the other's thirst.

